"segments": [
{
"start": 4.27,
"end": 10.29,
"text": " When Little Paris spoke at the end, everyone, of course, was immensely touched and impressed."
},
{
"start": 10.94,
"end": 14.42,
"text": "A lot of people were especially moved."
},
{
"start": 14.76,
"end": 18.62,
"text": "How do you think she was able to do that, get up and talk in front of that crowd?"
},
{
"start": 20.72,
"end": 26.51,
"text": "Well, she's a Jackson, you know, and that's all I can say about that at the moment."
},
{
"start": 27.73,
"end": 29.85,
"text": "But she's got a lot of nerves, yes."
},
{
"start": 30.85,
"end": 32.35,
"text": "Are you saying it's in the genes?"
},
{
"start": 34.98,
"end": 36.14,
"text": " Of course it's in the jink."
},
{
"start": 36.16,
"end": 37.15,
"text": "Who else could it be?"
},
{
"start": 38.63,
"end": 41.25,
"text": "Do you think these children might go into show business?"
},
{
"start": 42.88,
"end": 47.16,
"text": " I can't get into that right now, Larry, because I just can't."
},
{
"start": 48.16,
"end": 53.44,
"text": "But they like to watch movies and things, and they watch shows on TV and stuff."
},
{
"start": 54.32,
"end": 55.36,
"text": "What can I say?"
},
{
"start": 55.38,
"end": 60.0,
"text": "I mean, down the road, if they expressed an interest, I mean, you raised a family, they all got into show business."
},
{
"start": 60.4,
"end": 63.1,
"text": "If the grandchildren wanted to, would you encourage them?"
},
{
"start": 63.12,
"end": 65.28,
"text": "Larry, I know where you're trying to go with that."
},
{
"start": 65.84,
"end": 66.94,
"text": "I'm going to try to go anywhere."
},
{
"start": 66.96,
"end": 69.84,
"text": "I'm asking you, would you encourage them if they wanted to get into the business?"
},
{
"start": 69.86,
"end": 72.18,
"text": "No, I'm not encouraging them to do nothing."
},
{
"start": 72.5,
"end": 73.82,
"text": " None of a sudden."
},
{
"start": 74.3,
"end": 78.56,
"text": "They have to be what they are, kids at the moment, yes, and be raised properly."
},
{
"start": 79.22,
"end": 82.7,
"text": "So those rumors that you wanted to tour the Jackson 3 are not true."
},
{
"start": 82.72,
"end": 82.98,
"text": "Not true."
},
{
"start": 83.0,
"end": 84.26,
"text": "That's a bunch of jive."
},
{
"start": 84.28,
"end": 84.82,
"text": "That's a bunch."
},
{
"start": 84.86,
"end": 86.69,
"text": "I wish I could say what I should say."
},
{
"start": 87.28,
"end": 88.83,
"text": "That's a bunch of bull."
},
{
"start": 89.33,
"end": 90.39,
"text": "Yes, a bunch of bull."
},
{
"start": 91.15,
"end": 91.97,
"text": "You're his father."
},
{
"start": 93.05,
"end": 100.07,
"text": "If you pick up the phone and you call your son and you're worried about him and you know he's had some problems with this, why wouldn't you counsel him?"
},
{
"start": 101.27,
"end": 101.71,
"text": "Larry."
},
{
"start": 102.17,
"end": 103.83,
"text": " I'm gonna cut through the chase on this."
},
{
"start": 103.89,
"end": 105.29,
"text": "I could never get to him."
},
{
"start": 105.37,
"end": 106.65,
"text": "I tried all I could."
},
{
"start": 107.17,
"end": 113.28,
"text": "And I could never get to him because I was barred away from him by securities and all that type of thing."
},
{
"start": 113.78,
"end": 114.47,
"text": "I could not get to him."
},
{
"start": 114.5,
"end": 115.22,
"text": "They cut you off?"
},
{
"start": 115.8,
"end": 116.62,
"text": "That's right, Larry."
},
{
"start": 116.64,
"end": 117.48,
"text": "They cut me off."
},
{
"start": 119.08,
"end": 121.4,
"text": "Well, now, what if Michael asked to see you?"
},
{
"start": 123.2,
"end": 124.66,
"text": "Well, that's a horse of another color."
},
{
"start": 124.68,
"end": 127.92,
"text": "If he asked to see me, then he probably could have seen me."
},
{
"start": 128.36,
"end": 129.84,
"text": "All right, then why do you think he didn't?"
},
{
"start": 131.12,
"end": 133.1,
"text": " Well, I can't answer that, Larry."
},
{
"start": 133.52,
"end": 136.1,
"text": "Well, I knew I was barred from being around there to see him."
},
{
"start": 137.34,
"end": 138.9,
"text": "And then you was talking about foul play."
},
{
"start": 138.92,
"end": 140.28,
"text": "You want to know about foul play?"
},
{
"start": 141.04,
"end": 145.72,
"text": "If a doctor couldn't bring you back in this doctor, he ran away."
},
{
"start": 146.36,
"end": 148.64,
"text": "They had to look for him three days to find him."
},
{
"start": 149.36,
"end": 151.72,
"text": "So what do you think there is happening?"
},
{
"start": 151.98,
"end": 153.08,
"text": "To me, that's foul play."
},
{
"start": 153.8,
"end": 154.14,
"text": "All right."
},
{
"start": 154.5,
"end": 155.46,
"text": "That's your explanation."
},
{
"start": 155.48,
"end": 156.12,
"text": "That's fair enough."
},
{
"start": 156.16,
"end": 156.46,
"text": "Do you?"
},
{
"start": 158.22,
"end": 163.03,
"text": " What do you say about all these things that have been said over the years that you harmed Michael as a child?"
},
{
"start": 163.07,
"end": 167.73,
"text": "Oh, that's a bunch of bull s. That's a bunch of bull s. Straighten me out."
},
{
"start": 168.39,
"end": 169.21,
"text": "That's not true."
},
{
"start": 170.11,
"end": 171.53,
"text": "You never physically harmed him?"
},
{
"start": 171.89,
"end": 172.29,
"text": "Never."
},
{
"start": 172.65,
"end": 173.31,
"text": "Never have."
},
{
"start": 174.79,
"end": 177.95,
"text": "And I raised him just like you would raise your kids, you know."
},
{
"start": 178.59,
"end": 180.47,
"text": "But I harmed Michael for what?"
},
{
"start": 180.51,
"end": 181.13,
"text": "I have no reason."
},
{
"start": 181.17,
"end": 181.75,
"text": "That's my son."
},
{
"start": 181.81,
"end": 182.31,
"text": "I loved him."
},
{
"start": 182.71,
"end": 183.51,
"text": "And I still love him."
}
]
}